  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">A live-action, stop-motion story of a one glove coming up against a gang full of mobster gloves. Special thanks to Caroline Leaf, Nneka Bennett, Pete Grana, and J.K.</subfield>
  </datafield>
